/ActualText (Check the input and construct the source code of N both terminate, and H always halts. A does not run N. Thus A always halts and accepts exactly the inputs in L_TM-acceptance. By CTT, there is a TM with the same behaviour. Therefore L_TM-acceptance would be Turing-decidable.)
